Product Requirements Document (PRD)

Project: TableMate AI

⸻

1. Product Vision

Create an intelligent restaurant reservation platform that transforms traditional table booking into an immersive AI-powered dining experience.

⸻

2. Problem Statement

Existing booking platforms:

* Lack personalization
* Don’t visualize tables
* Don’t handle queue engagement
* Have poor UI experiences

Users want:

* Better seating control
* Smarter recommendations
* Faster booking
* Interactive experiences

⸻

3. Product Goals

Primary Goals

* Simplify restaurant reservations
* Improve customer engagement
* Reduce queue frustration
* Increase restaurant efficiency

Secondary Goals

* Gamify waiting experience
* Introduce AI-driven dining assistance
* Improve booking conversions

⸻

4. Target Audience

Primary Users

* Young adults
* Families
* Couples
* Corporate diners

Secondary Users

* Restaurant owners
* Restaurant managers

⸻

5. Key Features

Core Features

* Authentication
* Restaurant discovery
* Interactive booking
* Blueprint visualization

AI Features

* Smart recommendations
* Crowd prediction
* Queue alerts
* Dining assistant chatbot

Gamification

* Puzzle discounts
* Reward coupons

⸻

6. User Journey

Customer Flow

1. Sign up/login
2. Detect location
3. Browse restaurants
4. Select restaurant
5. View table blueprint
6. Choose table
7. Confirm booking
8. Receive confirmation

⸻

